\f0\b0  Lily was the rebel of the group, always pushing boundaries and testing limits. She worked part-time at the gas station downtown, where she met strange customers who spoke in codes only they understood. One night, after closing up shop, she followed one of these customers into an alleyway behind the building. \cb1 \
